{"steam_appid":1444080,"steam_name":"Dewdrop Dynasty","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1444080/957982650/b266c066fb2d77de7cc6ec07586f6cbcedc44c30/1779126533/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779139458","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257338928/772c65c06e53636237477a03d1a1756e6b11cefa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779139458","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/ss_ca301674fdb408941bbb810cc80c2512515c9ffd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785601317","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/d71dc4acae5e6c970f8a471ff9555c4fb60e4217/ss_d71dc4acae5e6c970f8a471ff9555c4fb60e4217.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785601317","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/254465f09e6411ab5fbcc4766260759a32945069/ss_254465f09e6411ab5fbcc4766260759a32945069.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785601317","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/668b52eee3c8d269dfb868c2e98e4b48dff3020f/ss_668b52eee3c8d269dfb868c2e98e4b48dff3020f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785601317","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/0c26b3ea4f956bf682f7af57753ebf9b91b155ae/ss_0c26b3ea4f956bf682f7af57753ebf9b91b155ae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785601317"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for a lighthearted Metroidvania that's isn't gloomy? We've got you covered.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dewdrop Dynasty</strong></i><strong> is a fast-paced, gun-jumping Metroidvania with a unique, retro-inspired pixel art style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.apng?t=1785601317\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.poster.avif?t=1785601317\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=87 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, jump, and explore your way through the world of Dewdrop—a interconnected land filled with hidden secrets, diverse biomes, strange monsters, and even stranger inhabitants.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so much to discover, bosses to face, and puzzles to solve, <i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> bursts with charm, challenge, and fast-paced fun. <strong>The world of Dewdrop won’t explore itself—so what are you waiting for?</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.apng?t=1785601317\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.poster.avif?t=1785601317\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=102 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/960a2d906241cfe74076ac7ca5a96bba.webp?t=1785601317\" width=20 height=14 /></span> Harness your inner gunslinger with gun-jumping, pistol-whipping action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/8bc7b2e4b116235762dd0ca3805253c2.webp?t=1785601317\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Collect and redeem tickets for fun prizes from vending machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/3deabea7a018325c1b4ba4f17a9d651e.webp?t=1785601317\" width=24 height=20 /></span> Unlock and wield unique items and strange abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/6ac436185874158274c27a781fb5c14c.webp?t=1785601317\" width=24 height=14 /></span> Wear a variety of silly, stylish, and occasionally useful hats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/aee6441e21e22313ef07ce607d124b32.webp?t=1785601317\" width=22 height=26 /></span> Enjoy a colorful pixel art style bursting with personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/62ff290a56db130be8d3b63ed8652dfb.webp?t=1785601317\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Mark up your map as you explore the world of Dewdrop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/5ba5862d309a11630eab679c3fc4b35c.webp?t=1785601317\" width=26 height=20 /></span> Face off against bosses and wacky enemies using items collected along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/a11da29f135b5c73696c07baca985c72.webp?t=1785601317\" width=24 height=26 /></span> Explore a lighthearted world full of charm, humor, and quirky characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/9e9bb4dbdb7f848d889d88cb017adb73.webp?t=1785601317\" width=20 height=20 /></span> Plus, an original soundtrack composed by the talented <strong>Peter Reid Jones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/8d73260d070ab7c08a2013939f867515.avif?t=1785601317\" width=600 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Goodgis"],"publishers":["Firith Studio"],"release_date":"Jul 23, 2026"}